# Where the core may allocate during play with OpenGL, by function
# (tools/gl/gl_allocs.sh, tools/vulkan/vk_alloc_sites.py; "heap", or "gl"
# for OpenGL names, storage, programs and shaders). AGENTS.md, "No
# allocations during play": the list only ever shrinks.

# The per-pixel renderer's copy of the depth for a frame of more than one
# render pass, made when the first such frame comes (made at the start, it
# would be video memory every game pays for)
gl gl4DrawStrips
